      t("passive-questions", "Which question is formulated CORRECTLY in the passive voice?", "Has the parcel been dispatched?", [["Has the parcel already been dispatched?", "voice-active-passive-mixup"], ["Did the parcel get safely dispatched?", "voice-question-error"], ["Was the parcel being dispatched today?", "voice-question-error"]], "Has the parcel been dispatched? is correct passive.")
